prompt:
Extract information from the text below and return ONLY valid JSON matching this exact schema. No markdown fences, no explanation — just the raw JSON object.

Schema: {"name": string, "language": string, "status": "active"|"archived"|"unknown", "tags": string[], "year": number|null}

Text: "Grimoire is a knowledge graph system I've been building since April 2026 in Node.js. It uses vectra for vector search and a JSON flat-file graph as its backing store. Still actively developed — just added an MCP server bridge this week. Core tools: oracle (search), scribe (write), crawl (NER), pathfind (graph traversal)."
